    "summary": "When this **[TRANSPORT](vsdata:core-rule/transports)** is [picked to shoot](vsdata:core-rule/shoot-step) in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) with units aboard:\n\n1. Pick up to X [embarked models](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) from units not yet chosen to shoot this phase.\n2. Pick 1 ranged weapon carried by each, other than [[ONE SHOT]](vsdata:core-rule/one-shot) weapons.\n3. The **TRANSPORT** has those weapons as well as its own until it finishes attacking.\n\nUnits aboard cannot shoot for the rest of the turn.",
